<title>USA: Cheung Labs names Blaha CEO, president.</title>
<headline>Cheung Labs names Blaha CEO, president.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBIA, Md. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cheung Laboratories Inc said on Friday it appointed Verle Blaha as acting president and chief executive.</p>
<p>Blaha most recently was senior vice president of Litton Industries Inc's microwave cooking products division. Augustine Cheung, the founder of the company, is relinquishing his post as president and CEO but will continue as chairman, the company said.</p>
</text>
